#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#26 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#27 (mes)
- "There was a toy factory in this town. All of the people in this town work there and I was one of the employees."
+ "Havia uma fábrica de brinquedos nesta cidade. Todo mundo aqui trabalhava lá, e eu era uma das funcionárias."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#28 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#29 (mes)
- "We all were happy in the beginning. We used to gather around together and have a friendly chat having gingerbread and hot tea after work."
+ "No começo éramos todos felizes. A gente se reunia e batia um papo amigável com pão de mel e chá quente depois do expediente."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#30 (select)
- "I couldn't even imagine, seeing this mood..."
+ "Nem dá para imaginar, vendo este clima..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#31 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#32 (mes)
- "Yes, because we couldn't earn a living by packaging toys forever. The situations got tough after the villagers left in ones and twos."
+ "Pois é, porque não dava para viver de embalar brinquedos para sempre. A situação apertou depois que os moradores foram embora, um a um."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#33 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#34 (mes)
- "I was the one who worked as an assistant beside the doll craftsman who made dolls to the end."
+ "Eu fui a que ficou até o fim, como assistente do artesão de bonecas."
