- "0x00ff44"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#151 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, maybe we should restore those toys and gift boxes to their original condition."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, talvez a gente deva devolver aqueles brinquedos e caixas de presente ao estado original."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#152 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Eh? I... I mean... To return them as they were.. Yes... We need to fight them? I don't know how exactly."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Hã? Eu... quer dizer... Fazer eles voltarem a ser o que eram.. Sim... A gente precisa lutar contra eles? Não sei exatamente como."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#153 (mapannounce)
- "Factory announcement: All employees must wear a proper uniform and identification. Please check with security if you do not have yours."
+ "Aviso da fábrica: Todos os funcionários devem usar uniforme e identificação adequados. Procure a segurança se não tiver os seus."
