- "0x00ff44"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#155 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Good heavens, I hope the guards are still human. There were boxes of uniforms near here in the past.."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Meu Deus, tomara que os guardas ainda sejam humanos. Antigamente havia caixas de uniforme aqui perto.."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#159 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, they are behind me. You'd better change into the uniform. Fortunately, I still have my employee card."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, estão atrás de mim. É melhor você vestir o uniforme. Por sorte, eu ainda tenho o meu crachá de funcionária."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#160 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: I will find my way around here. Let's meet near the second production line. Cheer up, it's a toy factory. It can't be all that bad!!"
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Eu me viro por aqui. Vamos nos encontrar perto da segunda linha de produção. Ânimo, é uma fábrica de brinquedos. Não pode ser tão ruim assim!!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#166 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah.. We have explored here before? Okay, let's meet at the same spot again."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah.. A gente já explorou aqui antes? Certo, vamos nos encontrar no mesmo ponto de novo."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#171 (mapannounce)
