- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#248 (mes)
- "Lucky you got here safely."
+ "Que bom que você chegou aqui em segurança."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#249 (select)
- "Quit the story"
+ "Encerrar a conversa"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#250 (select)
- "Listen to her tactics."
+ "Ouvir a tática dela."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#251 (select)
- "I know what to do. Proceed quickly!"
+ "Eu sei o que fazer. Vamos logo!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#252 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#253 (mes)
- "Oh, dear. Let me know when you are ready."
+ "Ah, meu Deus. Me avise quando estiver pronto."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#258 (mes)
- "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
+ "[Catherine Jet Johnson]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#259 (mes)
- "Hold on~ I am talking to your manager, so please wait."
+ "Espere~ Estou falando com o seu gerente, então aguarde."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#263 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: If you find all clues, search other places. I will look for the spot where I met the doll maker last time I was here."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Se você achar todas as pistas, procure em outros lugares. Eu vou procurar o ponto onde encontrei o fabricante de bonecas da última vez que estive aqui."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#264 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: This place was Factory No.2."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Este lugar era a Fábrica Nº 2."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#265 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: It used to be filled with people, but now it isn't."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Antigamente era cheio de gente, mas agora não é mais."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#266 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, I realized something while coming here. Some...Children..."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Ah, eu percebi uma coisa vindo para cá. Umas...Crianças..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#267 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: How can I say.. There were lots of very scary, but awfully sad, looking souls."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Como eu posso dizer.. Havia um monte de almas de aparência muito assustadora, mas terrivelmente triste."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#268 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: How pitiful they are, but please make them rest if they attack you. Fortunately, they won't come at me."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Coitadinhas, mas por favor faça elas descansarem se atacarem você. Por sorte, elas não vêm para cima de mim."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#269 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: If you see a worker toy on duty while searching here, would you ask it about the doll maker?"
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Se você vir um brinquedo operário de plantão enquanto procura por aqui, você pergunta a ele sobre o fabricante de bonecas?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#270 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: He might be sent to Heaven if they recall the memory of doll maker. That's the best hope."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Talvez ele vá para o Céu se lembrar do fabricante de bonecas. É a nossa melhor esperança."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#271 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: If you find all clues, search other places. I will look for the spot where I met the doll maker last time I was here."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Se você achar todas as pistas, procure em outros lugares. Eu vou procurar o ponto onde encontrei o fabricante de bonecas da última vez que estive aqui."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#272 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Sorry that I can't be a big help to you. See you in a minute."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Desculpe não poder ajudar mais. Até daqui a pouco."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#282 (mes)
