#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#303 (mes)
- "[Worker]"
+ "[Operário]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#304 (mes)
- "Huh? What happened?"
+ "Hein? O que aconteceu?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#305 (select)
- "No, nothing special"
+ "Não, nada de especial"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#306 (select)
- "Do you know about the doll maker?"
+ "Você sabe alguma coisa sobre o fabricante de bonecas?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#307 (mes)
- "[Worker]"
+ "[Operário]"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#308 (mes)
- "I'm working now! I'm very busy!"
+ "Estou trabalhando agora! Estou muito ocupado!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#309 (mes)
- "I'm very busy with working, so could you stop chatting?"
+ "Estou muito ocupado trabalhando, dá para parar de tagarelar?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#310 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Ah! Grandpa? He's a real good man. He oiled us everyday and cleaned the dust very often."
+ "Operário: Ah! O vovô? Ele é um homem muito bom. Ele nos lubrificava todo dia e limpava a poeira sempre."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#311 (npctalk)
- "Worker: I wish he wouldn't pass away. Ah... Ahah... I feel better."
+ "Operário: Eu queria que ele não tivesse morrido. Ah... Ahah... Estou me sentindo melhor."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#312 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Did Kimi kill the craftsman grandpa? Who said that? That's not true. Kimi was going to save him!"
+ "Operário: A Kimi matou o vovô artesão? Quem disse isso? Não é verdade. A Kimi ia salvar ele!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#313 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Ah... B.. By the way, why my does my body become..."
+ "Operário: Ah... A.. Aliás, por que o meu corpo está..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#314 (npctalk)
- "Worker: He had a chronic cardiac disease, but it was so sudden when it started and he died. Kimi found him and gave him first aid, but.."
+ "Operário: Ele tinha um problema crônico no coração, mas foi tudo tão de repente quando começou, e ele morreu. A Kimi achou ele e fez os primeiros socorros, mas.."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#315 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Ah.. Did you do something to me? I feel strange..."
+ "Operário: Ah.. Você fez alguma coisa comigo? Estou me sentindo estranho..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#316 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Kimi didn't move at all for sometime and sat down like ordinary dolls."
+ "Operário: A Kimi não se mexeu por um tempo e sentou como as bonecas comuns."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#317 (npctalk)
- "Worker: She was about to fly her soul forever... Like me now... Oh, my... What happened to me?"
+ "Operário: Ela estava quase soltando a alma para sempre... Como eu agora... Ai, meu... O que aconteceu comigo?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#318 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Oh, Kimi.. My dear.. She thought the doll maker passed away because she startled him."
+ "Operário: Ah, a Kimi.. Minha querida.. Ela achou que o fabricante de bonecas morreu porque ela assustou ele."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#319 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Grandpa was just very pleased that Kimi was moving.."
+ "Operário: O vovô só ficou muito contente de ver a Kimi se mexendo.."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#320 (npctalk)
- "Worker: He could see a living doll for a while. That's what Kimi first did."
+ "Operário: Ele pôde ver uma boneca viva por um instante. Foi a primeira coisa que a Kimi fez."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#321 (npctalk)
- "Worker: And what she first saw was his death. What a misery."
+ "Operário: E a primeira coisa que ela viu foi a morte dele. Que desgraça."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#322 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Kimi was able to hear the Grandpa's voice and feel before she was indwelled."
+ "Operário: A Kimi conseguia ouvir a voz do vovô e sentir, antes mesmo de ganhar alma."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#323 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Perhaps Grandpa's affection made her move and become alive. Ahah.. I'm sleepy.."
+ "Operário: Talvez o carinho do vovô tenha feito ela se mexer e ganhar vida. Ahah.. Estou com sono.."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#324 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Grandpa was a good man! Pity on Kimi! Kimi loved Grandpa! But Grandpa died. I'm sad!"
+ "Operário: O vovô era um homem bom! Coitada da Kimi! A Kimi amava o vovô! Mas o vovô morreu. Estou triste!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#325 (npctalk)
- "Worker: He was so amazed to see Kimi's opening eyes and his heart... It became like that."
+ "Operário: Ele ficou tão espantado de ver os olhos da Kimi se abrindo, e o coração dele... Ficou daquele jeito."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#326 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Anyhow, why my is my body... It's likely to float in the air.... Something strange."
+ "Operário: De todo jeito, por que o meu corpo está... Parece que ele vai flutuar no ar.... Que coisa estranha."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#327 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Kimi didn't hurt Grandpa! Kimi's wanted to save Grandpa! People are scared of Kimi, but Kimi is kind! Kimi is a good girl!"
+ "Operário: A Kimi não machucou o vovô! A Kimi queria salvar o vovô! As pessoas têm medo da Kimi, mas a Kimi é boazinha! A Kimi é uma boa menina!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#328 (npctalk)
- "Worker: Grandpa... I miss him. Grandpa, Grandpa..."
