#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#428 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Kimi! Listen to me. I didn't come here to blame you."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Kimi! Me escute. Eu não vim aqui para culpar você."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#429 (npctalk)
- "Celine Kimi: Everyone hates me!... You don't like me as well? This ugly and creepy doll likes me..."
+ "Celine Kimi: Todo mundo me odeia!... Você também não gosta de mim? Esta boneca feia e assustadora gosta de mim..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#430 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Kimi, I heard about you from dolls here. The doll maker adored you so much!"
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Kimi, eu ouvi falar de você pelas bonecas daqui. O fabricante de bonecas adorava você!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#431 (mapannounce)
