#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#438 (npctalk)
- "Celine Kimi: Did he... cherish me?"
+ "Celine Kimi: Ele... gostava de mim?"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#439 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Yes, when you start to move, he was so plea..."
