#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#464 (unittalk)
- "I don't want to be deserted. I don't want to be abandoned."
+ "Eu não quero ser largada. Eu não quero ser abandonada."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#474 (unittalk)
- "I will burn you with hell's inferno."
+ "Eu vou queimar você com o fogo do inferno."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#475 (unittalk)
- "Will you bear this flame?!"
+ "Você vai aguentar esta chama?!"
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#476 (unittalk)
- "I shouldn't have, but..."
+ "Eu não devia, mas..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#477 (unittalk)
- "It's boiling!... Bear it if you can."
+ "Está fervendo!... Aguente, se for capaz."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#478 (unittalk)
- "Breathe as much as you can. It'll be the last breath you take."
+ "Respire o quanto puder. Vai ser o seu último suspiro."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#479 (unittalk)
- "Frankly, I don't like fire."
+ "Para ser sincera, eu não gosto de fogo."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#480 (unittalk)
- "Everyone is afraid of me! What have I done so wrong?!"
+ "Todo mundo tem medo de mim! O que foi que eu fiz de tão errado?!"
