#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#541 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: What was the voice of that phantom? Why does it torment Kimi so harshly..."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Que voz era aquela do fantasma? Por que ela atormenta a Kimi com tanta crueldade..."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#542 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: I guess that the curse of my face was from the unidentified voice."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Eu acho que a maldição do meu rosto veio daquela voz desconhecida."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#543 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Anyway, even Kimi hates everyone and has collected her recollections here a lot."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: De todo jeito, até a Kimi odeia todo mundo, e ela juntou muitas lembranças aqui."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#544 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: I will end this thing safely even if her soul will return and she won't be disappointed."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Eu vou terminar isto em segurança, mesmo que a alma dela volte, e ela não vai se decepcionar."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#545 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: Thanks to you, everything that I have wondered is completely resolved. Please call me again if you are going to send her to Heaven next time."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Graças a você, tudo o que me afligia ficou resolvido. Por favor, me chame de novo da próxima vez que for mandá-la para o Céu."
#: npc/re/instances/HorrorToyFactory.txt#546 (npctalk)
- "Catherine Jet Johnson: I will open the exit way out. I will go outside first, so just follow me."
+ "Catherine Jet Johnson: Eu vou abrir a saída. Vou primeiro, então é só me seguir."
